# Docker build inputs: the *.npy/*.npz/detector.onnx rules above ignore the
# generated dataset, but the Dockerfile COPYs these three specific files (now under
# data/), so they must be tracked for a fresh clone to build the image. Tiny.
!data/detector.onnx
!data/trajectory.npy
!data/layer2_isam2_results.npz

